# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository AND on checkout.
# Without `eol=lf`, a Windows checkout under core.autocrlf=true materializes
# CRLF working-tree files, and `biome check` (lineEnding: "lf" in biome.json)
# then reports EVERY tracked file as needing formatting — the pre-commit hook
# can never pass on such a machine. The explicit eol attribute overrides
# autocrlf on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows scripts must keep CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binaries — never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
